31 (+10). No pipeline row and no CRM touch.\n4. **Quarry Records Retrieval:** Records Retrieval & Litigation Support under Tech-Enabled Business Services (+15). EBITDA $8.5M is at the edge of the band (+5). 20.2% margin against 18.0% (+5). Readiness: CFO Leon Galloway came from Kestwood Claims Services, a Glenhallow Partners Fund IV company (+15). Debt matures 2027-03-31 (+10). Founder CEO Esme Wakefield has run it 17.08 years with no successor (+10). New director Rafael Ortiz joined 2026-03-16 (+5). Positive call 2025-12-04 (+10).\n5. **Tessmark Clinical Supply:** Medical & Lab Supply Distribution under Specialty Distribution (+15), EBITDA $14.0M (+10), 10.0% margin against 9.0% (+5). Readiness: Cedar Row Partners engaged 2026-06-02 (+10). Debt matures 2028-02-28 (+10). Founder CEO Alicia Albrecht has run it 27.42 years with no successor (+10). New director Helen Voss joined 2026-02-17 (+5). Positive meeting 2026-06-10 (+10).\n6. **Fenwick Food Safety Labs:** Food Safety Testing under Testing, Inspection & Certification (+15), EBITDA $12.0M (+10), 18.2% margin against 17.0% (+5). Readiness: Sablewood Equity Fund II has held it 6.3 years (+15). Brackden Partners engaged 2026-09-08 (+10). Debt matures 2027-08-15 (+10). New director Elise Marchetti joined 2026-01-20 (+5). No pipeline row and no CRM touch.\n\nTwo of the six Tier A targets aren't in the CRM: Saltmarsh Home Infusion (80) and Fenwick Food Safety Labs (70). Nobody here owns either relationship, but both already have a banker engaged and debt maturing in 2027. A CRM screen would never surface them, because it only shows companies someone has already logged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3217,"cache_read_input_tokens":32908,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3217,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_trans